# Handoff 2026-10-25 13:05 — Teaching-layers GRILL locked + fix/interface-polish audit

## What is locked

`docs/features/teaching-layers/GRILL-teaching-layers.txt` is **Status: Locked**,
27 entries, ends with `No remaining open questions`. Key decisions:

- Teaching layer is an optional **ordered list** of parts on a card:
  - text `{ type: "text", text, lang? }`
  - image `{ type: "image", source: "builtin" | "web" | "local", src, alt }`
  - video `{ type: "video", source: "youtube" | "web" | "local", src, start?, end?, search?, alt? }`
- `teaching` is **excluded** from `canonicalContent` (`v1/src/lib/core/card.ts:58`).
  Layer-only edits keep the card and its evidence; question/answer edits retire
  the card and mint a new id.
- Deck becomes `{ id, name, level }`; missing level reads as `intermediate`;
  level is presentation only (`Settings.level` stays the generation fallback).
  - beginner: layer open
  - intermediate: folded, peeking adds a cold repeat
  - advanced: question first, layer after answer
- Word packs use a **lesson-first** flow: prompt "dog", answer "pies", layer
  "pies — pronounced pyes, the Polish word for dog". The answer may appear in
  the layer here (narrow exception), and `helpSeen: true` is set.
- **Listen** button per text-bearing layer: reads text parts in order, Listen /
  Stop, no autoplay, device SpeechSynthesis, per-part `lang`, skips missing
  voices with a plain note, disabled when speech is unavailable, teaching text
  only, carries a text label.
- Backup is **one zip**: `backup.json` + `media/`; autosave rewrites that zip.
  Pack export is zip (`pack.json` + `media/`) when it has local media, otherwise
  plain JSON. Import accepts both. Built-in and web media are never copied.
- Media caps: images ~1600px / 1MB, videos 20MB. Card never depends on media;
  offline and failure rules in entry 18.
- Built-in packs: **two only** — Browser Dev and Polish from Scratch.
  - Browser Dev: one pack, 14 decks; beginner 1–6, intermediate 7–10,
    advanced 11–14 (entry 24).
  - Polish from Scratch: 12 decks, beginner, words only, no sentences, no
    gender/case variants, text only (entries 22–24).
  - Anatomy Basics was dropped.
- Ticket `wayfinder/anything-learning-spec/tickets/browser-owned-packs.md`
  revised for the zip rule (#4, #9, Resolutions 3 and 5) with a dated note.

